# Sprint 51.6: LocalDiskDriver guarda los uploads en `apps/api/storage/`
# (root configurable via STORAGE_LOCAL_ROOT). En prod usar R2 con env
# STORAGE_DRIVER=r2 — el dir no se crea.
apps/api/storage/
/storage/

# =============================================================================
# Assets de juegos — temporal hasta que se generen los propios
# =============================================================================
# Carpeta local con screenshots de referencia (no commitear)
joker-jewells-imgs/
# Assets WebP/PNG procesados — temporales mientras esten en fase MVP
# interna. Cuando se generen assets propios (Sprint reskin), revisar.
apps/games/jokers-jewels/public/assets/symbols/*.webp
apps/games/jokers-jewels/public/assets/symbols/*.png
apps/games/jokers-jewels/public/assets/*.webp
apps/games/jokers-jewels/public/assets/*.png
# Excepciones: README.md sí se commitea
!apps/games/jokers-jewels/public/assets/symbols/README.md
!apps/games/jokers-jewels/public/assets/README.md

